  "scope": "Diagnosed ordinary managed printable-ASCII pie and doughnut point labels in embedded Noto Sans regular; office placement/reading order, other text/font and protected profiles remain open.",
  "provenance": "Two synthetic XlsxWriter 3.2.9 BSD-2-Clause labelled charts use an existing synthetic MIT OPC shell with enlarged page/chart and local workbook with two values adjusted; regeneration is byte-identical. Open XML SDK 3.5.1 validated sources, saved DOCX and API-authored DOCX. Offline LibreOffice 24.2.7.2 image sha256:a3aaef646226d406fc2b511462beb0359f4cd8859d775f404bd8f137dfd5f644 rendered sources, reopened saved documents and API-authored charts. PyMuPDF 1.27.2.2 and pypdf 6.10.0 inspected text, reading order and vector geometry. FontTools 4.61.1 independently inspected the embedded OFL Noto Sans face and sampled cubic-arc error. No Microsoft Word reference was available.",
