  "priorObservations": [
    "An initial focused build rejected an IndexOf expression under CA2249; the portable StartsWith form corrected it.",
    "A later focused build rejected the Framework-compatible hash expression under CA1850 and CA1872 on modern targets; a conditional modern hash implementation corrected it.",
    "The first working output interleaved each point label with its legend entry. Managed output now orders title, all labels, then all legend entries; the original PDF hashes are retained here, and the independent office reading order still differs.",
    "A font review narrowed circular labels to printable ASCII in the embedded Noto Sans regular face, and added half-point curved-arc clearance; both limits are independently checked."
  ],
